{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43601","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 光宅坊光宅寺 中禅师影堂联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 光宅坊光宅寺 中禅师影堂联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名下固无虚，敖曹貌严毅。\n洞达见空王，圆融入佛地。\n一言当要害，忽忽醒诸醉。\n不动须弥山，多方辩无匮。\n坦率对万乘，偈荅无所避。\n尔如毘沙门，外形如脱履。\n但以理爲量，不语怪力事。\n木石摧贡高，慈悲引贪恚。\n当时乏支许，何人契深致。\n随宜讵说三，直下开不二。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}